# Institutional credentials for UoA webmail and eClass.
#
# Prefer the managed store, which encrypts them at rest and puts them in a
# directory no other account can read:
#
#     ./bin/uoa-credentials.sh store uoa-mail     store them
#     ./bin/uoa-credentials.sh migrate            move an existing plain file in
#     ./bin/uoa-credentials.sh status             show where each secret lives
#
# This plain format is the fallback the store falls back to, and is still read
# from ~/.uoa-mail-creds or from the credential store directory. If you use
# it, chmod 600 the file.
#
# Line 1: username (without @uoa.gr)
# Line 2: password
# Line 3: optional separate SMTP password (defaults to line 2)
YOUR_USERNAME
YOUR_PASSWORD
